 simctl), App Store Connect","tier":"T2","capability":"T2 · network — makes outbound network calls","why":"matches app, flutter"}],"about_tiers":"Tier is a CAPABILITY (blast-radius) disclosure, not a safety verdict: higher just means look closer. Run check_capability on the live files before applying a story.","note":"Read each with get_story, and run check_capability before applying. Fewer, closer matches beat a padded list — if only one story truly fits, only one is returned."}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PfbkdJwYaLKA5ibMPKwqpF","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
